==Battleground==
*1 [[Haniwanwan]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Shachiko]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage's enemy lineup features a Bun Bun Symbiote with Shachiko, Oldhorn and Diabrollows as support. These enemies together can be a pain, but Bun Bun only appears after 57 seconds, allowing you to quickly clear the starting peons and use rushers such as [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to destroy the enemy base before Bun Bun spawns.

Alternatively, you can stall out for cash, which will be plentiful due to the Devil Wives, and then use heavy [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relic]]/[[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien]] attackers to quickly overthrow Bun Bun. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] works wonders for this strategy specifically, Slowing and Cursing most of the enemies.

